const TOF=[["contact","Reply to the first contact","The client wrote to the business line (Google Voice text or WhatsApp). Answer there, ask for full name, email and what they need, quote the price and ask how they will pay: now, later, or from the refund. Never ask for or accept SSNs, IDs or tax forms by chat; if one arrives, save it to the OLT file and delete it from the chat.","Log the contact"],
 ["sign3","Send the three documents","Engagement letter (client signs) and the separate Section 7216 Consent Form (client signs; both spouses on a joint return; new each year), sent from Google Docs: Tools ▸ eSignature. The Privacy Notice goes as a PDF, nothing to sign. No signed consent, no sharing with the preparer outside the United States.","Send letter, notice and consent"],
 ["portal","Send the MyTaxOffice portal invite","Only after the return is created and Personal Information is complete: Client Manager ▸ MyTaxOffice icon ▸ Client Portal ▸ Continue ▸ the client's email ▸ Send Link. The link expires 30 minutes after it is sent, so text the client right away. The client registers with name, date of birth and SSN or ITIN exactly as on the return (any mismatch makes registration fail, shown as error 122 in the app), then picks a username and password; the two-step code goes by text, or by email for a foreign phone. Option B: send the app passcode from Setup ▸ Mobile App. No SSN or ITIN yet: use the in-person ITIN meeting instead.","Send portal invite"],
 ["upload","Check DM Docs for the client's documents","Portal clients show a blue icon in Client Manager. Open DM Docs for the uploads (brokerage 1099-Composite statements upload from the app too). Use AI import for W-2s and 1099s, then check every number and look for duplicate entries. Compare what arrived with what the client described and ask for anything missing.","Open the uploads"],
 ["inv","Create the invoice in QuickBooks and send the pay link","OLT will not e-file until an invoice exists. Create the QuickBooks invoice and pay link, plus an OLT invoice for the same amount, marked paid once QuickBooks shows the payment. Pay from refund (a bank product) is only for after the EFIN and bank enrollment, with all fees explained in writing, and the client signs the bank's own Consent to Use and Consent to Disclose before the return is started.","Create invoice"],
 ["saved","Save the records","After acceptance (checked the same day; rejects fixed within 24 hours), text or WhatsApp the client the result. Download the full return PDF with worksheets, signed 8879, signed consent and engagement letter to IMPORTANT DOCUMENTS STORAGE ▸ Client Files folder ▸ 1_ACTIVE_in_progress, then move the client folder to 2_FINISHED_by_tax_year. Kept 7 years (IRS minimum 3). Never My Drive, desktop, Downloads or a phone.","Save to the client folder"]];
